WEBVTT

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:10.790
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.500
That's okay!

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.410
Let us go.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:19.410
We're going to the Aido Villa,

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:19.410
but Hanabusa isn't coming...

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.950
It feels sorta strange.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.330
It doesn't matter to me,

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.330
as long as I'm with Lord Kaname.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.700
Shiki, aren't you coming with us?

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:34.330
Nope. My parents keep nagging me

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:34.330
to visit, so I'm going home.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.290
Hmm...

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:38.910
Here.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Hmm?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.500
Good luck.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:59.160
Someone broke the taboo

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:59.160
and killed a Pureblood.

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:00.540
That is a fact.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.290
Why?!

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.700
We don't know what

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.700
Dorm President Kuran is thinking.

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.540
But there is nothing we can do.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:16.910
THE AZURE PORTRAIT

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.250
I know that the things

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.250
you told me weren't lies.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.620
Do you want to become

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.620
a vampire?

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.330
I can do anything if

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:37.330
it's for Lord Kaname's sake.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.410
That's what I thought.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.450
I'm scared.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.370
Scared? Of what?

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.040
I'm scared.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.660
What is it? This feeling.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:01.500
I'm scared.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.290
You cannot change the truth.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.290
What is truth?

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:08.910
I'm scared.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.250
Even if you avert your eyes,

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.660
-- it won't work.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.660
-- I'm scared.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.160
I'm scared.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.540
Where are you going, Cross?

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.080
Dorm President!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.660
I just want to remind you

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.660
that while we are on break,

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:22.750
the gates will be locked soon.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:23.870
Oh...

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.500
You may be from

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.500
the Disciplinary Committee...

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:29.200
But I wonder if it's wise

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:29.200
to visit the boys' dorm so freely?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.290
Umm...

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.200
In any case, you're not

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.200
making a good impression--!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.290
Huh?

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.200
Aido!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.330
Yikes!

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.750
There'd be hardly anyone here

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:40.750
if you sneak in during the break.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.200
Besides, this is the boys' dorm!

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:43.200
What do you want?

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:46.120
I-I didn't come here to

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:46.120
see Kiryu or anything...ugh!

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:47.200
Huh?

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.580
Aido! Why are you here?

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.250
-- Dorm President...?!

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.250
-- It's against the rules for

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.370
Night Class members

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.370
to come to the Sun Dorms...

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.500
-- Sorry, I was in the midst of running away.

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.500
-- Running away?

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:58.000
Can you pretend you didn't see me?

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.200
I understand. If I had been in

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.200
the Disciplinary Committee,

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:02.950
you would be punished, you know?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.660
Thank you!

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:11.330
Aido... I thought Night Class members

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:11.330
are not allowed in the Sun Dorms.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.160
H-He's right.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.330
You must go back to your own dorm.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.370
I don't want to stay in that dorm.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.870
So I absolutely refuse to go back!

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:21.450
Yuki... Go find a rope.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.080
We'll take him back even if

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.080
we have to tie him up.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.370
Hey, catch me if you can!

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.910
Don't waste my energy

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:29.910
with your stupid games.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.790
You should have just said nothing

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.790
and helped me run away.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.080
For the time being,

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:37.080
you won't mind staying in

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.200
the Headmaster's private room,

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.200
would you?

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.000
Or perhaps,

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.000
Zero's room in Sun Dorm?

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.290
-- No way!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.290
-- No way!

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:48.580
Um, Aido, you said you don't

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:48.580
want to stay in the dorm...

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:50.790
I'm hungry.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.120
Huh?!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.500
Why're you acting so wary?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.500
Home cooking is fine.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.500
Make something.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:02.370
Oh, and I like my bed soft,

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:02.370
and the linens to have a lavender scent.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.250
-- And of course my toothbrush should have

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.250
-- Now, now...

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.540
soft bristles as well.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.200
I don't like this.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:11.120
It wasn't a coincidence that Zero

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:11.120
and Ichiru met at the gala, was it?

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.330
They left Zero alone even though

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.330
he is a suspect of Shizuka Hio's murder

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.450
only to show deference

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.450
to Kaname Kuran.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.000
If, Ichiru, who has

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.000
a deep hatred for Zero,

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.410
attacked him to avenge Hio's death...

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.330
They won't let Kaname Kuran

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.330
to file a complaint,

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.540
because it'd be done

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.540
out of a personal grudge.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.410
Isn't that about the size of it?

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.580
If that was the case,

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.750
the Senate must have approached

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.750
the Hunter's Society with a deal.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.040
Or perhaps...

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.790
He ate our portion too...

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:48.410
I must say, it wasn't bad.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:48.410
Pretty average.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.250
But there wasn't enough.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:52.540
What a spoiled runaway.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.330
You look troubled.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:58.500
Oh yes. But I'll have

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:58.500
Kaname scold you later.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:06:59.830
How's that?!

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:02.450
Huh?

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:04.700
Huh?

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.700
He ate enough for three

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.700
and that's still not enough?!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.450
Yes, he looks listless.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.790
Is he hungry due to stress?

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.790
But does he even have stress?

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:14.080
Here.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.160
Oh!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.620
For now, give him a tablet.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:19.830
Oh...

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:23.580
I'll make something.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.450
It's okay. I don't mind cooking.

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.450
This unnatural, silent moment...

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.660
You too. Tell me if there's

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.660
something you feel like eating.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.500
Oh... salt ramen.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:42.500
Zero must be far more

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:42.500
uncertain and lonely...

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.410
And yet...

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.580
What is he thinking now?

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:51.290
It's late!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.290
He's making it now!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:56.330
He says to take a tablet for now!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.790
Is this Kiryu's?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.950
No, it's not!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:08.000
Don't get so worked up.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:08.000
I'm a genius, so I noticed these things.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.250
Err... Umm...

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.080
Kiryu knows that I'd notice.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.950
Lord Kaname knows too,

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:15.950
but hasn't said a word, right?

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:21.250
Although I don't understand

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:21.250
what Lord Kaname has on his mind.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.540
Aido...?

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.080
Why he treats

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.080
the likes of you so special...

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.040
The reasons why

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.040
he defied the Senate...

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.040
I just don't understand.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.540
He doesn't treat me special...

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:38.700
If you really mean that...

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:38.700
I'll kill you.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:48.120
There are two vampires

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:48.120
at the beginning of my memory.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:54.080
The very frightening vampire

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:54.080
who was about to eat me.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.200
And the kind, yet scary vampire

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:02.250
who destroyed that vampire

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:02.250
and saved me.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:10.200
Naturally, I idolized that kind vampire,

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:10.200
"Lord Kaname,"...

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:14.040
...and rather than "special,"

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:14.040
we have a very simple relationship.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:19.080
Simple, huh? Does that mean that

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:19.080
you trust him no matter what happens?

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:23.330
Umm... Well, to be frank,

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:23.330
sometimes I waver...

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.200
But I trust him.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.950
It's okay if he betrays me.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:31.450
Humph...

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.330
Rose tea...

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.410
It has such a refined fragrance.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.790
Maybe mixing in the rose jam

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.790
will make the flavor more intense.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.290
I prefer spreading

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.290
the jam on the cookies.

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:53.910
I brought you cookies, Miss Toya.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:55.870
No thanks, not now.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:57.620
I see...

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:01.330
By the way,

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:01.330
why didn't Aido come?

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.410
I don't know. Akatsuki shut himself

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.410
away in his room too.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.540
I don't know what's

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.540
going on with him.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.160
I need to ask a favor.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.750
The underground villa has records

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.750
of the night galas hosted by the Aido family

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.660
as well as the genealogies

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.660
of prominent families.

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:23.080
I want you to check if there is

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:23.080
anyone who could possibly have

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.290
a grudge against the Kuran family.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.660
What you're asking is very disturbing.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.330
I have a bad feeling.

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:35.000
That's why I want to learn more...

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:35.000
about Lord Kaname's secret.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.540
Why don't you go yourself?

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:40.540
Please...

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.080
Dorm President Kuran's secret...

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:52.830
Is it connected to

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:52.830
Shizuka Hio's death?

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.540
I'm home.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:15.750
Senri...!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.790
Senri... Senri...

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.540
I'm home, Mom.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.120
Comb your hair at least.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.040
If your fans from the days

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.040
you were an actress saw you now,

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.120
they'd be so disappointed.

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:37.250
You're starting to look more

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:37.250
and more like that brute.

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:41.950
Really? Well, I don't know

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:41.950
what my father looked like.

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:47.290
Oh yes, Uncle said to make certain

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:47.290
I send you over.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.540
You can't defy him.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.370
After all, he's a member of the Senate.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.250
But you're to return right away.

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.450
And give your starving mother...

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.450
some blood.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:04.620
You're so selfish...but I will.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.160
Lord Kaname...why?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:21.660
Hana, you're so smart.

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:21.660
Reading a difficult book like this!

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:26.250
Young Misses, break time is over.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.700
-- Okay!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.700
-- Okay!

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:31.290
Oh, you're studying!

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:37.200
The master mentioned how happy

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:37.200
he was to have such a fine son.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.200
Hmm...

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:44.160
Umm...

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.410
I thought I felt a presence of a child,

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.410
so I peeked in.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.330
Are you a member of this family?

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.080
I...

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:57.950
Wh-Who are you?!

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:57.950
How rude to just burst in here!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.750
Lord Kaname! Is something wrong?

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.080
I'm sorry I barged in.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:05.330
No such thing.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:07.370
Did our Hanabusa do anything rude?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.660
Huh?! Father! He's the rude one!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:10.950
No...

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:12.410
Huh?

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:16.370
There aren't any kids

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:16.370
my age around me, so...

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.660
I'm Kaname Kuran.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.410
Kuran? That's one of

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.410
the Pureblood families...

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.200
Will you be my friend?

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:28.620
No!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:33.120
H-How can you say such

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:33.120
a reckless thing, Hanabusa?!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.120
So what if he's a Pureblood?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:41.580
It seems that you need a lesson

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:41.580
on the origin of our kind.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.000
Our founding ancestors

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.000
appeared in ancient times,

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.790
when human civilization was

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.790
on the brink of destruction.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.160
Those who propagated

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.160
without mixing a drop of their blood

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.910
with other kinds are the Purebloods.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:57.700
In time, as the population

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:57.700
of vampires grew,

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:00.080
it was necessary to

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:00.080
designate a sovereign.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.910
And the Kuran family was

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.910
chosen to be our sovereign.

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:06.250
O-Oh... he's that important?

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.870
He didn't look it at all.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.910
I mean, really!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.040
The sovereign two generations ago

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.790
disapproved of

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.790
the concentration of power...

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.450
...so the monarchy

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.450
was abolished and now,

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.200
the Senate rules over

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:18.200
our vampire society.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.700
Oh, so he's not that important, after all.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:29.750
But it's an easy thing for them...

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:29.750
to rest power away and raise an army.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.160
They can do it right now,

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:34.160
if they felt like it.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:40.660
Say, is it true that you refused to

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:40.660
become friends with Lord Kaname?

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:41.910
Huh?

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.250
What kind of person

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.250
was Lord Kaname?

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.120
He's strong, and perfect,

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.120
and really important, right?

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:48.540
Not really.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.000
Oh...

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:52.750
Good evening.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.000
Good evening.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:59.540
Hanabusa, do you have a moment?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.000
I'm in the middle of

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.000
testing sand materials

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.580
for our Strength-testing Research Lab.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.700
I don't want to be disturbed.

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:07.160
Oh!

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:14.540
I must have done something

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:14.540
to upset you.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:19.080
I wanted to apologize, so I insisted

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:19.080
that I be allowed to come again.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.370
I'm sorry.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:26.580
Are you stupid?

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:26.580
You didn't do anything wrong!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:32.080
Oh, them? Sorry, don't mind them.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.450
A protective escort?

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:37.450
More like a guard.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.040
You don't need to apologize.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.290
I just don't like you, Lord Kaname.

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:48.410
He's feared so much, and there's

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:48.410
so much expected out of him...

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.200
But he's very kind.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:54.160
He's much better than me...

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:57.200
Poor Lord Kaname...

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:02.040
He lost both his parents at once.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.700
They committed suicide...

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.250
Oh...

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.040
U-Umm...

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.040
So you've reached the age

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.040
when you can attend the night galas.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:15.000
My deepest sympathy.

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:16.790
Thank you.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.500
You met my parents once, right?

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.950
Yes. They looked very kind.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.660
Yes, they were very kind people.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.080
Are we done here, Master Aido?

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:31.660
Huh?

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.160
Well then, good bye.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.200
Oh...

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:39.330
Was there something else

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:39.330
that was difficult for you?

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.040
Why do you think that?

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:46.500
Oh... N-No reason.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.410
I'm asking why.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.580
Was he this scary?

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.830
There's a change in you.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:03.660
Oh... Is that all?

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.120
I thought for a moment that

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.120
I would have to kill you...

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.120
if you knew something else.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.450
I'm kidding.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.450
It was a bad joke, wasn't it?

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.080
Lord Kaname...

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:22.330
There is someone who wishes

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:22.330
to offer her sympathies.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:25.910
All right, I will be right there, Ichio.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:27.500
Sympathy?

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:32.870
Lord Kaname!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:36.040
If you don't want something,

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:36.040
it's okay to speak up!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.620
So I'm asking, why?

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:43.000
I-I know because I'm your friend!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:47.120
Didn't you say you hated me?

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:52.200
No! I like you, but I hated myself

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:52.200
for being unable to admit it!

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:53.540
Huh?!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:07.200
Lord Kaname!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:07.200
I like you...Lord Kaname!

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.540
I made up my mind then.

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:17.200
That I would become someone

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:17.200
who would protect him.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:24.370
But from about the time his parents died,

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:24.370
Lord Kaname has changed.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:29.830
And the nobles seem to be afraid of

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:29.830
something and avoid any mention of it.

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:34.620
His parents loved Kaname

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:34.620
and cherished him so much...

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:38.040
Why? Why did they

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:38.040
have to commit suicide?

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.250
What're you doing?

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:42.580
Sorry!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:43.660
Oww!

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.040
Leave it alone. I'll...

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:46.120
Wait!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:52.000
Isn't Zero afraid?

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:56.040
I...I...

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.250
Lick it.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:02.370
I'm scared...

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.160
Zero's fangs touch my finger...

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:17.160
No! Don't resist it.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.160
I'm the only one...

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:21.160
who knows your hunger.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:24.200
So...

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:26.660
Yuki...

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:31.620
Zero tells me that I am here.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:36.450
Even if he doesn't know what he is...

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:42.580
This dull ache... Blood...

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.540
What am I to you, Yuki?

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:49.080
What Zero means to me...

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.790
Eyes dyed crimson stare at me.

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:57.080
Vampire eyes.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:00.660
I'm scared, but I can't look away.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.160
Why...?

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.040
Huh?!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.700
What an annoyance?!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.700
What was that?!

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:18.790
That Kiryu...

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.000
He's possessed by blood.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:26.540
Huh?! Why am I worrying about him?!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.200
I should be worrying

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.200
about Lord Kaname.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:33.080
It's okay if he betrays me.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.120
I feel the same way!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.540
I do...!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.750
Kaname is planning to do something.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:05.120
My mind is set then...

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.250
Huh?

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.540
Aido's not here either.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.950
Maybe he changed his mind

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.950
and went back to the Moon Dorm?

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:16.370
Huh? After putting up such a fuss?

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.120
He said he was running away,

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.120
but all he did was eat our food!

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.250
What happened to you?

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:26.000
Uh? What do you mean?

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.200
Nothing happened.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:32.660
Don't try to hide it.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:32.660
You are very unstable.

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:36.330
Don't force yourself to laugh

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:36.330
when you're with me.

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:38.660
Oh...

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:48.000
I'm so spoiled. I have

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:48.000
the Headmaster, Kaname, you and Yori...

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.000
Yet, I still feel so anxious.

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:58.750
If I become a vampire,

00:21:55.290 --> 00:21:58.750
do you think I would feel stronger?

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:04.870
Kaname asked me if I wanted to

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:04.870
become a vampire, and I...

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:08.330
You thought it might be a good idea

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:08.330
to become a vampire.

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:13.080
Oh... But Kaname wasn't serious and...

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:15.250
I won't let you become such a thing.

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.910
Even if I have to make an enemy

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.910
of Kaname Kuran...

00:22:20.160 --> 00:22:22.370
or even if you hate me.

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:06.580
Next time:

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:06.580
"Devil's Awakening"
